<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</title>
<headline>Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat weekly estimate, to Nov 27, of 1995/96 shipments (1996/97 wheat), 1995/96 export commitments (1996/97 wheat) and purchases by exporters in indicated crop years (thousands of tonnes).</p>
<p> ...........shipments..commits..crop year...exporter purchases</p>
<p> .............................................1995/96..1996/97</p>
<p> Bread wheat	0.0  5,300.0   Dec-Nov	4,756.0  2,455.0</p>
<p> Maize	  6,452.1  2,000.0   Mar-Feb	6,538.3    535.0</p>
<p> Sorghum	  655.1    650.0   Mar-Feb	  634.5     14.3</p>
<p> Soybeans     1,993.6  2,000.0   Apr-Mar	2,126.9    580.5</p>
<p> Sunseeds	 541.1    600.0   Jan-Dec	  579.3     14.3</p>
<p>--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541-318-0650</p>
</text>
